# s57a — the stored tag (option A): nord is a bool column, written bits, the corpus
# norm. The world is DATAMODEL.md's notebook page verbatim: gold, master, and the tag
# over rows 0 2 3. Twin registry s57-derived-tag-b.reg spells the same denotation as a
# derived tag; the demo pins are identical across both — that equality is the claim.
n 5
col nord bool 1 0 1 1 0
col gold num 400 600 200 150 221
rel master 2 -1 -1 4 -1
ja 北 nord
ja 金 gold
